        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Saturn Grade 2 Commercial Door Lever</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe  Schlage Saturn lever provides durability in even the most abusive commercial applications. Made by Schlage, The AL-Series Saturn Lever keyed lever lock utilizes the original high quality A-Series cylindrical chassis supported by heavy duty spring cages providing strength and performance in the more abusive commercial Grade 2 applications. Components such as threaded hubs and locking nuts literally \"bolt\" the lock chassis to the door to prevent loosening. A heavy duty spring cage utilizes compression springs to support levers from drooping. The interlocking spindle design gives internal strength to the lock when excessive force is applied to the lever while in the locked position. UL rated for a 3-hour fire door. Available with backsets ranging from 2-3/8\" up to 5\". This lever and rose set will work with door thickness ranges from 1-3/8\" up to 1-7/8\". With a full range of functions to choose from, there is one to meet any application need.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Saturn AL-Series Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2-2003, Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant: meets the Americans With Disabilities Act. In compliance with the American National Standards Institute (ANSI A117.1) and the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA).</li>\r\n<li>UL fire rated for 3 hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Keying 6-pin, Schlage C keyway (Keyed functions only).</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li>Steel, zinc dichromated lock chassis for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>All exposed trim is wrought brass and bronze. Levers are pressure cast zinc.</li>\r\n<li><b>3-year mechanical warranty for all functions.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Saturn Schlage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: adjustable from 1-3/8” to 1-7/8”.</li>\r\n</li>Backset: 2-3/4” (70 mm), 2-3/8” (60 mm), 3-3/4” (95 mm) and 5” (127 mm).</li>\r\n<li>Front: Steel. 2-1/4” x 1 -/8” square corner, beveled, for 2-3/4” backset standard. Optional 1” square corner, 1” radius corner, and non-UL drive-in / round face.</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Brass, chrome plated, 1/2” throw, deadlocking on keyed and exterior functions.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: ANSI curved lip strike 4-7/8” x 1-1/4” x 1-1/4” lip to center standard. Optional strikes, lip lengths and ANSI wrought strike box available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Saturn Grade 2 Commercial Door Lever, Schlage AL-SAT",
                "description": "Schlage AL-Series Saturn Commercial Door Lever AL-SAT - The Saturn Lever features an easy to grip angular handle. Made by Schlage, The AL-Series Saturn Lever keyed lever lock utilizes the original high quality A-Series cylindrical chassis supported by heavy duty spring cages providing strength and performance in the more abusive commercial Grade 2 applications. Components such as threaded hubs and locking nuts literally bolt the lock chassis to the door to prevent loosening. A heavy duty spring cage utilizes compression springs to support levers from drooping. The interlocking spindle design gives internal strength to the lock when excessive force is applied to the lever while in the locked position. UL rated for a 3-hour fire door. Available with backsets ranging from 2-3/8 inches up to 5 inches. This lever and rose set will work with door thickness ranges from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-7/8 inches.",
                "keywords": "Schlage al series, schlage Saturn levers, Al10ssat, al40Sat, al170sat, al53sat, al70sat, al80sat, SCH-AL-SAT, simple commercial door levers, Saturn schlage levers, Saturn door handles, commercial door handles, ul fire rated door hardware, al50sat,"
